{"summary":"The host-read excerpts cover an approved plan (.agents/plans/2026-10-28-model-items.md, status approved 2026-10-28, depends on 0.8.16) that introduces an «item» (предмет) as a unit of the image pipeline in the «Текстура по модели» (Texture by model) section of the Image Studio plugin. The item's source of truth is items/<item>/item.json in the game folder; the plugin KV holds only a project index (id, name, step statuses, thumbnails) for the panel. Steps run in order: concept → blueprint → model → uv-guide → texture → preview → export, each with a status (— empty, … running, ✓ done), a list of entries, and a selected entry (selected, selectedBy: agent, user in panel, or CLI). New runs with --item are written to items/<item>/<step>-<run>/; old runs and external files are attached by reference, not moved. The plan lists four tasks: item-core (src/item.ts, CLI, agent tool, generate --item, step linking, selected, gallery itemId, price table), item-export (export step), item-panel (the Items sub-tab, step-strip cards, take selection, gallery badge), and item-skill. item-panel depends on item-core. The plan's panel section: a «Предметы» sub-tab lists cards; each card shows a step strip left to right with status marks and the selected take marked; clicking a take selects it. Gallery images of an item get a badge with the item id, and clicking it opens the card (gallery entries gain an itemId field). The plan's acceptance criteria are: a plunger-scepter item assembled from existing files without generation, all steps ✓ in item.json, the panel showing the strip and selected take with the gallery badge working, and texture-uv with --item reusing the model and concept from the item.

The model-panel.tsx excerpt (L1-L534, read partially) shows the existing ModelPanel component. It takes props api, projectId, styles, version, locale, onError, onChanged. It holds styleId, mode (texture-uv or blueprint), and takes (ModelTakeWithThumbs[]) loaded via api.model_takes({styleId}) with a version dependency. It renders a project picker, a settings form (save_gui_style), a list of takes with thumbnails (data URIs from base64) and labels, and a bottom form with mode buttons and inputs that call api.model_generate. There is no sub-tab switch or Items view in the excerpt. Labels come from t(key, {}, locale) with I18nKey types. The excerpt cuts off inside the bottom form, around the projectConcept checkbox, so the rest of the file is unseen.

The session context includes a SessionStart note that another window (resume) claims .agents/plans/2026-10-28-model-items.md, which may mean concurrent work on the same plan. The task contract's owned paths and verification commands are stated in the task, not in the excerpts.","keyFacts":["Plan .agents/plans/2026-10-28-model-items.md: status approved 2026-10-28, depends_on 0.8.16 (model-guide-fix2, model-blueprint-nb21).","Source of truth for an item is image-studio/model/<project>/items/<item>/item.json in the game folder; KV holds only a project index for the panel, and item.json wins on conflict.","Pipeline steps in order: concept → blueprint → model → uv-guide → texture → preview → export.","Each step has a status (— empty, … running, ✓ done), entries (run or file: paths, prompt, model, gateway, price, time, source generated|attached), and selected/selectedBy (agent, user in panel, or CLI).","New runs with --item are written to items/<item>/<step>-<run>/; old runs and external files are attached by reference and not moved.","Plan tasks: item-core, item-export (depends on item-core), item-panel (depends on item-core), item-skill (depends on item-core).","Plan panel section: an «Предметы» sub-tab with item cards; each card has a left-to-right strip of step thumbnails with ✓/…/— status and the selected take marked; clicking selects a take.","Plan gallery section: gallery images of an item show a badge with the item id; clicking it opens the item card in the model tab; gallery entries gain an itemId field.","Plan acceptance: plunger-scepter assembled from existing files without generation; all steps ✓ in item.json; panel shows strip, selected take, and gallery badge; texture-uv with --item reuses model and concept from the item.","Plan decision (approved): export is an FBX without embedded textures plus separate PNG maps (color, normal, and roughness/metal if present), a .blend source, and fbxScale project setting defaulting to 0.01 for Roblox.","Plan decision (approved): concept is attach-only, by file or gallery id from the roblox/character sections.","Plan price table: Muse/fal $0.01 and nano-banana-2.1/kie 1K $0.02; unknown prices are null.","Plan states that the build (bb plugin build) is run by the PM before release; checks are npx tsc --noEmit and node --test --experimental-strip-types tests/*.test.ts.","model-panel.tsx L1-L534 (excerpt): ModelPanel props are api, projectId, styles, version, locale, onError, onChanged.","model-panel.tsx: state includes styleId, mode (texture-uv | blueprint), takes (ModelTakeWithThumbs[]), and running; takes load via api.model_takes({ styleId }) with a version dependency.","model-panel.tsx: generate() calls api.model_generate with mode, model, object, prompt, parts, images, size, variants, subject, conceptNote, projectConcept, conceptView, and blueprint fields.","model-panel.tsx: labels are resolved with t(key, {}, locale) using I18nKey and Locale types from ./i18n; the take list renders thumbs as data URIs built from base64 and mimeType.","model-panel.tsx: the excerpt has no sub-tab switch, no Items view, and no item-related RPC calls; those are to be added.","Task contract: RPCs model_items({styleId}), model_item({styleId, item}), model_item_select({styleId, item, step, entry}) with selectedBy 'user'; thumbnails are cached like model_takes thumbs.","Task contract: version 0.9.2 in package.json; tests in tests/item-panel.test.ts; owned paths include model-panel.tsx, app.tsx, i18n.ts, server.ts, src/item.ts, src/item-server.ts, tests/item-panel.test.ts, package.json.","Task contract invariants: GitNexus impact analysis is required before editing existing app.tsx, model-panel.tsx, or server.ts functions; no new dependencies; never touch blender/, host.ts, skills/, .agents/, dist/, node_modules/, .claude/, and similar paths.","Task contract out of scope: export logic and the skill.","SessionStart note: another window (resume) claims the plan file .agents/plans/2026-10-28-model-items.md, so concurrent edits to the plan are possible."],"openQuestions":["Whether item.json, the item index in KV, and the item-core module (src/item.ts) already exist: the excerpts do not show src/item.ts, its schema, or item-core's status, though the contract lists it under read_first and owns_paths.","The exact shape of the RPC contract in server.ts (rpcContract), including existing model_takes, and whether thumbnail caching is already implemented there.","The current state of app.tsx and the gallery tab, including whether gallery entries already carry an itemId field.","The rest of model-panel.tsx beyond L534 (the excerpt is cut off at the projectConcept checkbox), including where a sub-tab switch would fit and whether a tab component exists.","i18n.ts key structure and whether the ru/en dictionaries are typed by I18nKey so new keys must be added to both.","Test setup: whether tests/ already has helpers for RPC and KV fakes, and whether node --test --experimental-strip-types works with the current Node version.","Whether item-core and item-export are complete. The plan lists dependencies, but the excerpts don't show their status, which matters since item-panel depends on item-core.","Whether the other window that claims the plan file will change the plan or the task scope, which could conflict with this work.","The current version in package.json (the contract requires 0.9.2, which implies the current one is 0.9.1 or similar, but this is not shown).","The exact shape of the step's selected entry and of thumbnails in item.json, which the plan does not fully specify (for example, thumbnail file paths versus inline base64 for model_items)."]}
